Description: Windows Subsystem for Android (WSA) on Ubuntu Linux
 Port of Windows Subsystem for Android (WSA) to Ubuntu.
 Features Android 12.1 (API 32) images with Google Play Store (MindTheGapps),
 Magisk root solution, seamless desktop integration, and 3D acceleration.
